### Get Engine Config
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/engine
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get Effective Engine Config
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/engine/effective
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get Available Engine Options
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/engine/options
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Engine Config
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/engine
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "mode": "CASCADE",
  "sttProvider": "gemini",
  "ttsProvider": "gemini"
}
